148
00:07:25.010 --> 00:07:26.070
What is it?

149
00:07:26.630 --> 00:07:30.310
It is 11-22-63 by Stephen King.

150
00:07:30.450 --> 00:07:32.190
Oh, that's a really good one.

151
00:07:32.450 --> 00:07:35.150
It is one of my all-time favorite books.

152
00:07:35.150 --> 00:07:38.490
It's not horror, but there is a fantasy time travel element.

153
00:07:38.930 --> 00:07:39.790
Here's what it's about.

154
00:07:39.910 --> 00:07:44.830
The main character discovers a portal where he can go back in time, and he decides that

155
00:07:44.830 --> 00:07:47.210
