160
00:07:51.330 --> 00:07:56.910
My partner has read it, but years ago, when we'd go on walks, he was telling me the plot.

161
00:07:57.050 --> 00:07:57.510
Oh, no.

162
00:07:57.610 --> 00:07:58.550
So you know the plot.

163
00:07:58.710 --> 00:08:00.950
But he told me this like over five years ago.

164
00:08:01.050 --> 00:08:04.730
I remember a little bit about a romance, but everything else I don't remember.

165
00:08:04.970 --> 00:08:05.870
You know what, Cassie?

166
00:08:06.050 --> 00:08:08.230
The romance is my favorite part of the book.

167
00:08:08.650 --> 00:08:10.550
I'm telling you this book, it's like beautiful.

168
00:08:10.850 --> 00:08:11.610
It's beautiful.

169
00:08:11.610 --> 00:08:13.650
And also, the past is obdurate.

170
00:08:14.210 --> 00:08:15.270
