174
00:08:19.870 --> 00:08:20.390
Obdurate.

175
00:08:20.550 --> 00:08:22.390
It means the past is unmovable.

176
00:08:22.910 --> 00:08:23.430
Oh.

177
00:08:23.870 --> 00:08:26.510
It's the phrase that stuck with me after I read it.

178
00:08:26.710 --> 00:08:29.410
I'm so intellectual of you.

179
00:08:29.690 --> 00:08:31.570
Oh, I guess you're surprised.

180
00:08:31.970 --> 00:08:38.510
You know what stuck with me is there's a moment where he drinks root beer, and it like,

181
00:08:38.510 --> 00:08:44.210
I don't know, the way it was described was like one of my favorite passages.

182
00:08:44.910 --> 00:08:45.450
Obdurate.

183
00:08:45.770 --> 00:08:49.070
Stubbornly refusing to change one's opinion or course of action.

184
00:08:49.350 --> 00:08:49.850
Oh.

185
00:08:50.150 --> 00:08:51.270
That's a little hint.

186
00:08:51.810 --> 00:08:52.230
All right.

187
00:08:52.350 --> 00:08:54.990
But that's the phrase he says over and over.

188
00:08:55.570 --> 00:08:55.810
Jenna.

