194
00:09:09.590 --> 00:09:12.290
She does like this little like, I don't know.

195
00:09:12.410 --> 00:09:16.670
You can't see me because I'm on a podcast, but I'll do it, and I'll put it in stories.

196
00:09:16.990 --> 00:09:17.250
Okay.

197
00:09:17.730 --> 00:09:21.570
Sam, would you like to turn around and get your red wrapped gift?

198
00:09:21.870 --> 00:09:22.550
I would.

199
00:09:22.770 --> 00:09:23.150
Thank you.

200
00:09:23.510 --> 00:09:23.750
Okay.

