204
00:09:29.730 --> 00:09:31.770
You've read my year of rest and relaxation?

205
00:09:32.450 --> 00:09:32.510
I have, yes.

206
00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:33.150
Okay.

207
00:09:33.150 --> 00:09:38.730
So, Sam, that is one of the most original weird books I've ever read in my life.

208
00:09:38.910 --> 00:09:39.290
Agreed.

209
00:09:39.490 --> 00:09:39.730
Okay.

