00:09:39.890 --> 00:09:42.630
This book is her new book, Lepvana.

211
00:09:42.930 --> 00:09:43.470
Lepvana.

212
00:09:43.790 --> 00:09:46.390
The author is Otessa Moshfeg.

213
00:09:46.610 --> 00:09:47.030
Uh-huh.

214
00:09:47.190 --> 00:09:51.350
